  abstract={These are the anciliiary files to the article at https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.00138, presenting the JustAct framework of policy-regulated open-multi-agent systems.Included are two complementary artefacts: A Rocq Specification of the framework, and of the Rust implementation. A Rust Implementation of the framework, and its instantiation as an executable program, including unit tests realising the case study. See the README files for each of these artefacts for more details on how they may be used. See the article for the big picture, e.g., motivating the framework and detailing how the artefacts are related.}
